    "approved_revision": null,
    "approval_scope": "revision 4 of algebra.absolute_value_relations (revision 3 unchanged for its eight operations: the same constraints give the same matrix and the same payload). Domain: new operation place_weighted_points_on_number_line (textbook 例題2 / 隨堂練習2): labelled points (p·a+q·b)/(p+q) with positive integer weights on AB, a<b; answer = exact relative position t=q/(p+q) of each point plus the ascending order; points must be at least 1/6 of AB apart (more than twice the 1/20 grading tolerance). Adapter: multi_part payload, part (1) input_kind number_line_placement graded by number_line_placement_checker (per-point tolerance 1/20 of AB, no pixel comparison), part (2) ordered_inequality_checker; both parts required. Skill bindings: PointDivision gains place_weighted_points_on_number_line. Requires runtime: core/checkers/number_line_placement_checker.py registered in checker_registry and multi_part_answer_checker, plus the practice-page number-line widget."
  },
